OL,3,GNEWSAWhy do construction projects get  
OL,4,Ahit by so many delays?                 
OL,6,FIt's an increasingly common scenario - 
OL,7,Fa local authority announcing that a    
OL,8,Fmajor development won't be delivered on
OL,9,Ftime.                                  
OL,11,FAcross Yorkshire, key construction     
OL,12,Fprojects have been beset by delays, in 
OL,13,Fsome cases struggling to progress and  
OL,14,Fending up years behind schedule.       
OL,16,FCouncils and other public bodies often 
OL,17,Fhave to explain to taxpayers why these 
OL,18,Fschemes are delayed or over budget, and
OL,19,Fthe reasons can be wide-ranging.       
