OL,3,GNEWSAWhy do construction projects get  
OL,4,Ahit by so many delays?                 
OL,6,FOne example is Stocksbridge, near      
OL,7,FSheffield. In 2019, as part of the     
OL,8,Fgeneral election campaign, the         
OL,9,Fgovernment announced major investment  
OL,10,Fin the town. Levelling Up funding of   
OL,11,F#24m was promised for a new library and
OL,12,Fbusiness hub.                          
